    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "text": "私は、それから神社に戻ってきて、彼が自室に戻ると、一人縁側で昔のこと、彼が幻想郷に来た日を思い出していた…",
      "notes": "（霊夢）私は、それから神社に戻ってきて、彼が自室に戻ると、一人縁側で昔のこと、彼が幻想郷に来た日を思い出していた…",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ワタシワ、ソレカラジンジャニモドッテキテ、カレガジシツニモドルト、ヒトリエンガワデムカシノコト、カレガゲンソーキョーニキタヒオオモイダシテイタ",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 10.134512471655329,
      "audio_file": "slide_002.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.002.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "sound_effects": [],
      "effect": "none",
      "quality_enhance": true,
      "sound_effect": null,
      "se_offset": 0,
      "no_voice": false,
      "is_skipped": false,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_002.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "text": "その日、まだ幼かった私は、母の隙をついて、ひっそりと普段は出られない外に出て、結界の近くを歩いていた。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）その日、まだ幼かった私は、母の隙をついて、ひっそりと普段は出られない外に出て、結界の近くを歩いていた。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ソノヒ、マダオサナカッタワタシワ、ハハノスキオツイテ、ヒッソリトフダンワデラレナイソトニデテ、ケッカイノチカクオアルイテイタ。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 9.154512471655329,
      "audio_file": "slide_003.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.003.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "sound_effects": [],
      "effect": "none",
      "quality_enhance": true,
      "sound_effect": null,
      "se_offset": 0,
      "no_voice": false,
      "is_skipped": false,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_003.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "text": "ふとした好奇心で外に出た私は、博麗神社という名前や結界のことなど知らなかった。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）ふとした好奇心で外に出た私は、博麗神社という名前や結界のことなど知らなかった。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "フトシタコウキシンデソトニデタワタシワ、ハクレイジンジャトイウナマエヤケッカイノコトナドシラナカッタ。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 6.765759637188209,
      "audio_file": "slide_004.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.004.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_004.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 5,
      "text": "そして、結界の近くを歩いているうちに、ある人間を…、幼い彼の姿を見かける。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）そして、結界の近くを歩いているうちに、ある人間を…、幼い彼の姿を見かける。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ソシテ、ケッカイノチカクオアルイテイルウチニ、アルニンゲンオ、オサナイカレノスガタオミカケル。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 6.5745124716553285,
      "audio_file": "slide_005.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.005.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_005.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 6,
      "text": "そのとき、私は彼と一緒に神社で遊ぼうと考え、彼に声をかける。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）そのとき、私は彼と一緒に神社で遊ぼうと考え、彼に声をかける。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ソノトキ、ワタシワカレトイッショニジンジャデアソボウトカンガエ、カレニコエオカケル。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 5.619501133786848,
      "audio_file": "slide_006.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.006.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_006.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 7,
      "text": "そして、私は神社へと来た道を戻っていく。だが、彼との距離に間ができ、彼を急かす。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）そして、私は神社へと来た道を戻っていく。だが、彼との距離に間ができ、彼を急かす。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ソシテ、ワタシワジンジャエトキタミチオモドッテイク。ダガ、カレトノキョリニマガデキ、カレオセカス。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 7.522018140589569,
      "audio_file": "slide_007.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.007.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_007.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 8,
      "text": "やがて私は、林道を走り出し、ふと足を止めて後ろを見る。すると、彼はこけて気絶していた。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）やがて私は、林道を走り出し、ふと足を止めて後ろを見る。すると、彼はこけて気絶していた。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ヤガテワタシワ、リンドウオハシリダシ、フトアシオトメテウシロオミル。スルト、カレワコケテキゼツシテイタ。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 7.912018140589569,
      "audio_file": "slide_008.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.008.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第4話/slide_008.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916321308,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 9,
      "text": "私は、彼に近づき、全身を揺らす。そして、目を覚ますように声をかける。",
      "notes": "（霊夢）私は、彼に近づき、全身を揺らす。そして、目を覚ますように声をかける。",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ワタシワ、カレニチカズキ、ゼンシンオユラス。ソシテ、メオサマスヨウニコエオカケル。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 6.629501133786848,
      "audio_file": "slide_009.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第4話/第4話.009.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "_cacheBuster": 1787916424483,
      "sound_effects": [],
      "effect": "none",
      "quality_enhance": true,
      "sound_effect": null,
